# Claude Code: allowlist only. ~/.claude holds private state (history, transcripts,
# memory, sessions, caches), and ~/.claude.json holds account data. Never track those.
claude/.claude/*
!claude/.claude/settings.json
!claude/.claude/CLAUDE.md
!claude/.claude/agents/
!claude/.claude/commands/
!claude/.claude/skills/
claude/.claude/skills/synced/
**/.claude.json
**/.claude.json.backup
**/settings.local.json
